# ── Build context exclusions for the Komik Hub web frontend ────────────────
# node_modules is 111 MB on this checkout and is fully rebuilt by `npm ci`
# from the lockfile; dist/ is regenerated by `npm run build` in the builder
# stage. Both would otherwise be copied into the build context every time.

# Dependencies + build output
node_modules
**/node_modules
dist
dist-ssr

# VCS / editor / OS noise
.git
.gitignore
.vscode
.idea
*.swp
*~
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Secrets / local config (nginx.conf IS needed — do not ignore it)
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Logs + caches
*.log
npm-debug.log*
.vite
.cache
.tmp
coverage
.hermes-tmp.*

# Docker artifacts (avoid recursive context)
Dockerfile
Dockerfile.*
.dockerignore
docker-compose*.yml

# Docs / RE artifacts not needed in the image
*.md
!README.md
